msgid ""
"Only 128 custom palettes can be listed. Keep fewer JSON files in the themes "
"folder to see the rest."
msgstr ""
"Er kunnen maar 128 aangepaste paletten worden getoond. Houd minder JSON-"
"bestanden in de themamap om de rest te zien."

